WP = "Original product-style concept art of a single weapon for a stylized cel-shaded comic-book brawler video game. Bold clean black ink outlines, two-tone cel shading with tinted (not black) shadows, flat colours, simple readable shapes, no texture noise, no gradients. The weapon lies centered on a plain flat light-grey background, shown whole, slightly angled from above, large in frame with a margin, no hands, no ground shadow, no text, no letters, no logos, no watermark. Absolutely no red or pink anywhere. It is a late-1980s street-gang weapon, chunky and exaggerated so it reads from across a room, low-poly friendly: simple shapes, big links. "
